{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o026c","title":"曹操闻于禁降叹惜","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o026c-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"曹操闻于禁降叹惜","evidence":["zhangle-e-o026c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"叹惜","evidence":["zhangle-e-o026c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"闻于禁降后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhangle-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhangle-q-o026","basis":"闻于禁降后"},"evidence":["zhangle-e-o026c-q","zhangle-q-o026","houfei-q-o007","houfei-q-b-0d9729850beb4de84286"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o026c-q","source_order":[17,79,"O026c"],"order":3535}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-0d9729850beb4de84286","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0d9729850beb4de84286","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-381f09fa2187aad74833","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"houfei-q-o007","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-07f96fb1afeb6f19fbe8","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，拜为王后。策曰：“夫人卞氏，抚养诸子，有母仪之德〖2〗，今进位王后。太子、诸侯陪位〖3〗，群卿上寿〖4〗；减国内死罪一等〖5〗。”","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"zhangle-e-o026c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-b487aba048617fe0bc2c","layer":"original","quote":"太祖闻之，哀叹者久之，曰：“吾知禁三十年，何意临危处难，反不如庞德邪！”","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":109,"end":145},{"id":"zhangle-q-o026","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-b487aba048617fe0bc2c","layer":"original","quote":"迁左将军，假节、钺；分邑五百户，封一子列侯。建安二十四年，太祖在长安，使曹仁讨关羽于樊，又遣禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水溢，平地水数丈，禁等七军皆没。禁与诸将登高望水，无所回避。羽乘大船就攻禁等，禁遂降；惟庞德不屈节而死。太祖闻之，哀叹者久之，曰：“吾知禁三十年，何意临危处难，反不如庞德邪！”会孙权擒羽，获其众，禁复在吴。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
